   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Tallahassee** (1 review): Listener admires the expanded version of the song, citing its recent live evolution [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **No, I Can't**: back after 31 archived shows (761 days); rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **The Mess Inside**: back after 137 archived shows (3066 days) [3]\n- **Weekend in Western Illinois**: back after 103 archived shows (1916 days); rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Masher**: back after 24 archived shows (664 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **The New Hydra Collection**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Let Me Bathe in Demonic Light [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2021-12-17** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 123 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2021-12-17**: taped by Liz Hamilton; transferred by Liz Hamilton; source: Zoom H1 Handy Recorder [1]. Also: Uploader lists the setlist, mapping each song to its original album source [1]",
